{"v":1,"id":"a10ca9e61233","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"Seven seals… seven cries…","s":13.97,"e":17.26},{"t":"Thunder rolls where heaven divides.","s":17.35,"e":20.62},{"t":"Light breaks — the scroll unwinds,","s":20.71,"e":23.36},{"t":"Behold — the riders ride!","s":23.42,"e":39.55},{"t":"White horse burning through the dawn,","s":39.58,"e":42.83},{"t":"Crown of conquest, battle drawn.","s":42.9,"e":45.07},{"t":"Bow stretched tight in trembling hands,","s":45.11,"e":49.27},{"t":"Kingdoms fall at his command.","s":49.32,"e":52.07},{"t":"The seals are breaking, sky’s unmade,","s":52.09,"e":55.58},{"t":"Trumpets sound — the stars decay.","s":55.6,"e":58.99},{"t":"Voices rise through smoke and flame,","s":59.08,"e":62.16},{"t":"Calling out the ancient name.","s":62.24,"e":68.41},{"t":"Ride — Ride — the horsemen ride!","s":68.47,"e":71.58},{"t":"Echoes of the end collide.","s":71.62,"e":74.98},{"t":"War and Famine, Death, and Pride,","s":75.04,"e":78.16},{"t":"Heaven quakes — the truth denied.","s":78.22,"e":81.33},{"t":"Ride — Ride — across the void,","s":81.43,"e":84.53},{"t":"Seven seals now destroyed.","s":84.62,"e":87.72},{"t":"From the Lamb the scroll was torn,","s":87.78,"e":90.57},{"t":"The final dawn… reborn.","s":90.65,"e":97.16},{"t":"Red horse brings the rivers' roar,","s":97.19,"e":100.39},{"t":"Peace departs — the drums of war.","s":100.44,"e":103.72},{"t":"Black horse weighs the world in chains,","s":103.76,"e":105.87},{"t":"Bread for blood — the hunger reigns.","s":105.9,"e":110.0},{"t":"Pale horse rising, ghostly pale,","s":110.02,"e":113.26},{"t":"Death and the pit tip the scale.","s":113.32,"e":116.52},{"t":"Souls beneath the altar cry,","s":116.61,"e":119.33},{"t":"“How long, O Lord, till justice nigh?","s":118.6,"e":123.05},{"t":"Ride — Ride — the horsemen ride!","s":123.06,"e":138.84},{"t":"Echoes of the end collide.","s":138.88,"e":142.36},{"t":"Every moon bleeds in the tide,","s":142.41,"e":145.28},{"t":"Heaven tears, the veil denied.","s":145.35,"e":161.16},{"t":"Seal by seal the world is torn,","s":161.19,"e":164.55},{"t":"Angels cry, the Lamb adorned.","s":164.64,"e":166.81},{"t":"Thunder breaks — silence dies,","s":166.91,"e":170.56},{"t":"Behold… the riders ride.","s":170.63,"e":212.4},{"t":"Seal by seal the world is torn,","s":212.48,"e":215.78},{"t":"Angels cry, the Lamb adorned.","s":215.87,"e":218.95},{"t":"Thunder breaks — silence dies,","s":219.03,"e":221.71},{"t":"Behold… the riders ride.","s":221.77,"e":237.67},{"t":"Then heaven falls to sacred hush,","s":237.74,"e":241.23},{"t":"Before the storm — no breath, no rush.","s":241.28,"e":244.36},{"t":"Trumpets gleam with molten flame,","s":244.38,"e":247.32},{"t":"The Earth awaits its final name.","s":247.38,"e":263.68},{"t":"Ash and gold drift through the air,","s":263.74,"e":267.07},{"t":"Every heart laid bare in prayer.","s":267.12,"e":270.04},{"t":"From the Throne, the storm begins,","s":270.09,"e":273.15},{"t":"TRUMPETS CALL FOR RECKONING!","s":273.2,"e":289.34},{"t":"Seven flames ignite the sky,","s":289.43,"e":292.45},{"t":"Seraphs weep and mortals cry.","s":292.49,"e":295.53},{"t":"Judgment sings, creation bends,","s":295.56,"e":298.77},{"t":"Thus the seals give birth to the end!","s":298.79,"e":304.88},{"t":"“The end… the end… the end…”","s":302.03,"e":314.85}],"match":null}
